ent conformance (3.1.0 identity, both response rows per operation, public empty security, authenticated ApiKeyAuth + x-required-action, required-string-in-path parameters), (ii) envelope schema_version enum pinning to `output.SuccessSchema` / `yerr.SchemaVersion`, (iii) example redaction via `output.Sentinel` with negative assertion against the credential-shaped `yalla_sk_<env>_<value>` pattern; the self-check `TestVerificationSuiteOpenAPIConformanceAnalyzerDetectsRegressions` drives every matcher with 11 synthetic known-good AND known-bad fixtures. Per-story knobs for siblings: (a) canonical subset command, (b) dedicated CI step name, (c) verify.sh numeric prefix (next number after the last required step; renumber the trailing optional steps in the same edit), (d) SECURITY.md section heading and 11-13 substring set covering every AC, (e) PRD requiredBackendCommands entry (insert near siblings in the array; keep the umbrella entry FIRST), (f) canonical reference test file path + closed conformance-triple func-name set + the `-run` filter prefix the canonical-funcs entries MUST satisfy. Load-bearing invariant: ONE FILE, SIX SURFACES, SELF-CHECK; drift on any surface fails ONE test, not six.
